              "emailMessage/Subject": "🛑ALERT: EVRI Monitor and Alert for All Datasets Flow FAILED",
              "emailMessage/Body": "<b>🚨 ALERT: EVRI Monitor and Alert for All Datasets Flow FAILED</b>\n\n\n<b>Flow Name:</b> <code>@{workflow().name}</code>\n\n\n<b>Run ID:</b> <code>@{workflow().run.name}</code>\n\n\n<b>Time:</b> <code>@{utcNow()}</code>\n\n\n<b>Status:</b> One or more device processing scopes (ZebraTC75, BYOD, ET45, etc.) have <span style=\"color:red\"><b>FAILED</b></span> or timed out.\n\n\n<b>Action Needed:</b> Please check the Power Automate run log for more details.\n\n\n<i>This is an automated alert from Power Automate.</i>\n",
